```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

September 20, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration to Purchase between the City of Cheyenne, and RCN Technologies
for the purchase of Twelve (12) Connected Emergency Blue Light Call Stations
______________________________________________
This is a Sole Source purchase through RCN Technologies, therefore no bids were requested.
RCN Technologies is the sole manufacturer of the RCN-BLCS-120V-CP920-3YR Call Light
Product.  As such, this purchase can only be fulfilled by RCN Technologies.
The City of Cheyenne Community Recreation & Events Department, Cheyenne Police
Department, and Compliance Department has done extensive research on other comparable
products, and RCN Technologies is the only manufacturer that meets all of their requirements to
provide the required safety features.
The total requested purchase amount is $145,301.60

Funding:
032-21-2113-45-43110 (SPOT / Downtown Projects Maintenance - 2021 Ballot)
```

